    "description": "A delicate, deciduous, spreading, shrubby tree about 1. 5m tall and 2. 5m wide, forming a weeping dome of finely dissected, fresh green foliage, opening pale green and turning yellow and orange in autumn; ideal for containers or in a raised rockery",
